{"id":"c3c84ebd86018553","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-cfg-ordered-derivation-histories.md","title":"最左与最右推导的完整历史","display":"df-cfg-ordered-derivation-histories — 最左与最右推导的完整历史","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-cfg-ordered-derivation-histories","aliases":["73-df-cfg-ordered-derivation-histories"],"display":"df-cfg-ordered-derivation-histories — 最左与最右推导的完整历史","depends_on":["[[73-df-cfg-leftmost-derivation]]","[[73-df-cfg-rightmost-derivation]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§5.4.3, Theorem 5.29, print pp. 212–213; PDF pp. 234–235; explicit history representation","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":5},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-cfg-ordered-derivation-histories"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-cfg-ordered-derivation-histories</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cfg-ordered-derivation-histories — 最左与最右推导的完整历史"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c57bbf0a680e199a\" href=\"?note=c57bbf0a680e199a\" title=\"73-df-cfg-leftmost-derivation\">73-df-cfg-leftmost-derivation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"077d066c160ae693\" href=\"?note=077d066c160ae693\" title=\"73-df-cfg-rightmost-derivation\">73-df-cfg-rightmost-derivation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§5.4.3, Theorem 5.29, print pp. 212–213; PDF pp. 234–235; explicit history representation"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"5"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_\\Sigma\">\\(G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in\\{\\mathsf{lm},\\mathsf{rm}\\}\">\\(d\\in\\{\\mathsf{lm},\\mathsf{rm}\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}}((V\\cup\\Sigma)^*)^n\">\\(\\rho\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}}((V\\cup\\Sigma)^*)^n\\)</span> 是候选非空句型历史，时间下标属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 并从零开始。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hist}_{G,d}(w)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\rho\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}}((V\\cup\\Sigma)^*)^n:\n\\rho(0)=\\langle S\\rangle\\land\\rho(|\\rho|-1)=w\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|\\rho|-2\\}\\;\\rho(i)\\Rightarrow_{G,d}\\rho(i+1)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Hist}_{G,d}(w)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\rho\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}}((V\\cup\\Sigma)^*)^n:\n\\rho(0)=\\langle S\\rangle\\land\\rho(|\\rho|-1)=w\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|\\rho|-2\\}\\;\\rho(i)\\Rightarrow_{G,d}\\rho(i+1)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>历史保存每个步骤，包括 A→A 的自环步骤；删除重复句型会混淆不同长度的推导。只记录可达关系本身不足以计算歧义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-leftmost-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"c57bbf0a680e199a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-leftmost-derivation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-rightmost-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"077d066c160ae693","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-rightmost-derivation]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in\\{\\mathsf{lm},\\mathsf{rm}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}}((V\\cup\\Sigma)^*)^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hist}_{G,d}(w)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\rho\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}}((V\\cup\\Sigma)^*)^n:\n\\rho(0)=\\langle S\\rangle\\land\\rho(|\\rho|-1)=w\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|\\rho|-2\\}\\;\\rho(i)\\Rightarrow_{G,d}\\rho(i+1)\\right\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1518,"backlinks":[{"id":"34c08ba68aabce9a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-ordered-derivation-histories]]"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-83","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-ordered-derivation-histories|最左与最右推导的完整历史]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"48fc86014ba6508f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["c57bbf0a680e199a","077d066c160ae693"]}